{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53382","headline":"问如满禅师 二 · 顺宗皇帝李诵","name":"问如满禅师 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛向王宫生，灭向双林灭。\n住世四十九，又言无法说。\n山河及大海，天地及日月。\n时至皆归尽，谁言不生灭？\n疑情犹若斯，智者善分别。\n（《景德传灯录》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顺宗皇帝李诵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}